%% UI owners: packages/message/src/lib/components/chat-content/chat-content.component.ts:1；packages/message/src/lib/enum/enum.ts:1；src/app/message-host/runtime/im-gate/helix/helixTauriImGate.service.ts:1（实际命令与关联回灌）
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：成员从搜索结果 / @提醒 / 书签点进某条消息，列表定位到它并高亮
  Note over UI,Web: 合同登记快照（不等于当前实现或实测）：mock=not_applicable；helix=partial；dual=yes；personaLocal=yes；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: queryMessages(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_locate_message", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_locate_message", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_locate_message", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 跳转到指定消息并可双向翻页 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /api/cses/posts/postContext（cursorVersion=1；已支持默认 20 / 最大 60）
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(projection + cursor)
  Host->>DB: transaction message window + timeline cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>IM: release only matching authority corr
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist ScopedGet(readback)
  Host->>DB: durable readback
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
  E->>IM: readback is the projection source
  IM->>Sink: Effect::Emit im:read:result（请求关联结果）
  Sink-->>Gate: im:__bus__ 按 req_id 或 requestId 结算等待者
  Gate-->>UI: render absolute snapshot or query result
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：返回包含 locatePostId 的权威上下文窗口，目标尽量位于 floor(limit/2)，边界不足时向另一侧补足；Angular 不扫描本地全量缓存制造定位窗口；一个 reqId 只返回一个 terminal QueryMessagesResult；hasOlder / hasNewer 与 opaque olderCursor / newerCursor 同时给出，供定位后双向翻页；定位完成后高亮该条并把它滚入视口（滚动与高亮配置见 enum.ts），高亮不得覆盖用户后续手动滚动；目标不在本地缓存时必须能从服务端拉取该消息所在窗口后再定位（不得空列表）
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：定位后不得自动滚底（滚底会立即丢失定位位置）；目标不在本地缓存时不得静默回落 latest 尾窗；必须回源目标上下文，权威返回不存在 / 不可见 / 已撤回时才允许关联失败或明确空态；limit 缺省必须是 20，显式值只允许 1..60；超过 60 不得产生 I/O
  Note over E,Sink: 结果出口：im:read:result；读结果与业务广播区分，不能把无广播理解为无 Effect::Emit
